  "bodyHash": "6a552ea78008b1d5",
  "content": "\n\n<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\"\n    alt=\"features\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img\n    width=\"80%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/049bbd21fa6bffe1c747d1686aab04ee4086d8fd.gif\"\n    alt=\"features\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n<span>\n我們精心製作了這個模組，為您帶來靈感來自最新 Minecraft 更新的主題。 <br> <strong>目前僅支援 Fabric 載入器，若未來有需求，我們將考慮移植至其他載入器與版本！</strong><br>我們計畫在未來新增更多功能，歡迎加入我們的 Discord 分享您的想法！\n<br>\n  <br>\n<strong>警告！此為伺服器端模組。請勿在有反作弊系統的伺服器上使用，否則可能會被封禁。</strong>\n</span>\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/CXttaCyGCN\">\n  <img alt=\"discord\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/25b3523cedf0cb3f3c12740f07400b5bc306954b.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@mypunchymod\">\n  <img alt=\"tiktok\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c455866e8b8d992e586e9d61e5cd905dcc6c84de.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@punchyxp2\">\n  <img alt=\"youtube\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c6ea4d87bf707d2f9f0bf59633d29ebede5c9fd7.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://github.com/punchy-mod/punchy-wiki/wiki/\">\n  <img alt=\"github\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0197a0dce279690de37a1f899b3d25edf9d3bac2.png\">\n</a><a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/modinpunchy\">\n  <img alt=\"ko-fi\" width=\"60px\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8a0c2971228a3266c56e4dcdeef1229af0974192.png\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n\n  \n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <div>\n    <iframe \n      width=\"560\" \n      height=\"315\" \n      src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MUWsQ1Riu6U?autoplay=1&mute=1\" \n      title=\"YouTube 影片播放器\" \n      frameborder=\"0\" \n      allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture\" \n      allowfullscreen>\n    </iframe>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<div>\n    <img\n    width=\"100%\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cca5699bd7a66a33c1411fbdbae0ad410892b98a.png\"\n    alt=\"features\"\n  />\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <img\n    width=\"220px\"    \n    src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6b09dbb834c1380dbec2c950fb7091d806ba74d3.png\"\n    alt=\"features\"\n  />\n<br>\n<br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/6f666ccd1e5d20f3d700ba937d6301c3159dee21.gif\"\nalt=\"features\"\n/> \n  <br>\n<br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/3b1ad2ea8ee2437387ede0a61bda0b2adcc6939d.gif\"\nalt=\"features\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>丟木棍</summary>\n手持木棍並按下可設定按鍵時，玩家會將木棍丟出很遠。小狼會追過去撿回並帶回給玩家，接著會注視著玩家等待，直到木棍被從牠嘴裡拿走為止。\n</details>\n  <br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/2acaefde40b0a9d544fb86eb4668d172b8a52986.gif\"\nalt=\"features\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>與小狼玩耍</summary>\n抱著小狼時，按下「I」鍵即可觸發互動玩耍動畫。\n</details>\n<br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/9a0ea409bdb29da4b4c100d0885ee9d9328a4499.gif\"\nalt=\"features\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>攜帶幼年生物</summary>\n蹲下並右鍵點擊即可抱起幼年生物。小狼擁有專屬的動作動畫。將其抱在懷中時按下「I」鍵即可互動。\n</details>\n<br>\n<img\nwidth=\"100%\"\nsrc=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/FDqBVN2B/images/08b7dd7279fd6c0ea622029e6ae248ecc0120a8e.gif\"\nalt=\"features\"\n/>  \n<details>\n<summary>吹哨召喚小狼</summary>\n按下可設定按鍵即可召喚半徑一個區塊內最近的小狼。若您有多隻小狼，按下備用按鍵即可不分距離同時召喚所有小狼。\n</details>\n\n\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
